*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_eCPRI_Sync_Counters
    [Documentation]         This test is responsible for eCPRI sync counters verification.
    ...                     For counters to be collected, eCPRI protocol should be configured on one of the RMODs
    ...                     (It can be verified by checking radioProtocolType parameter in WebEM or SCF file).
    ...                     Counters collection starts always on a full quarter, so for example:
    ...                         execution started at 14:38:05 - additional 0:07:25 of waiting will be performed.
    ...                     Also as counters are reported with delay (14:45 counter will be reported at 15:00),
    ...                     test waits for one more time interval than stated by 'number_of_measurements'
    ...                     Preconditions:
    ...                         - initial value of eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval set on BTS shall be different than
    ...                         the first value in the "intervals" list
    ...                     Args:
    ...                         - intervals: list of different eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval values to be checked
    ...                         during test execution (first one shall be different than the value set on BTS).
    ...                         It is possible to pass any number of interval values, but by default two values shall be checked
    ...                         - number_of_measurements: desired number of counters to be collected and verified
    [Arguments]                                                 ${intervals}=${None}
    ...                                                         ${number_of_measurements}=1
    @{intervals}=           run keyword if                      """${intervals}"""=='None'
    ...                                                         Create List
    ...                                                         5min    15min

    ${mrbts_id}=                                                tl_config.get_bts_instance_id
    ${dist_name}=           Set Variable                        MRBTS-${mrbts_id}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/PMMNL-1

    ${initial_interval}=                                        Save eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval initial value
    ...                                                         dist_name=${dist_name}

    Check initial interval value vs first of intervals list     initial_interval=${initial_interval}
    ...                                                         first_interval=${intervals}[0]

    FOR    ${interval}     IN    @{intervals}
        Set eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval via admin             interval=${interval}
        ...                                                     dist_name=${dist_name}
        Wait For Counter Data Frames Generation                 interval=${interval}
        ...                                                     number_of_measurements=${number_of_measurements}
        Perform eCPRI sync counters verification                interval=${interval}
        ...                                                     number_of_measurements=${number_of_measurements}
    END
    [Teardown]                                                  Run Keywords
    ...                                                         Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                         Changing eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval back to its initial value ${initial_interval}...
    ...                                                         AND
    ...                                                         Set eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval via admin
    ...                                                         interval=${initial_interval}
    ...                                                         dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                         AND
    ...                                                         Robot Log Result
    ...                                                         eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval successfully set back to ${initial_interval}

Save eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval initial value
    [Arguments]                                                 ${dist_name}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Saving initial eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval value...
    ${parameter_value}=                                         counters.get_value_of_parameter
    ...                                                         dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                         parameter_name=eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval

    Robot Log Result                                            Initial eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval value was ${parameter_value}
    [Return]                                                    ${parameter_value}

Set eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval via admin
    [Arguments]                                                 ${interval}
    ...                                                         ${dist_name}
    Robot Log Operation                                         Changing eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval to ${interval}...
    Change PM Interval To                                       dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                         abbr_group_name=eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval
    ...                                                         interval=${interval}

    Robot Log Result                                            eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval successfully set to ${interval}

Wait For Counter Data Frames Generation
    [Arguments]                                                 ${interval}
    ...                                                         ${number_of_measurements}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Waiting for Counters Data Frames Generation...

    gnb_counter.Wait for PM measurements                        interval=${interval}
    ...                                                         measurements=${number_of_measurements}

    Robot Log Result                                            Done, BTS counters frames have been generated!

Perform eCPRI sync counters verification
    [Arguments]                                                 ${interval}
    ...                                                         ${number_of_measurements}
    Robot Log Operation                                         Starting verification of eCPRI sync counters...
    gnb_counter.Validate intervals and values counters eCPRI    interval=${interval}
    ...                                                         measurements=${number_of_measurements}
    Robot Log Result                                            eCPRI sync counters verification succeded!

Check initial interval value vs first of intervals list
    [Arguments]                                                 ${initial_interval}
    ...                                                         ${first_interval}
    Robot Log Operation                                         Checking if initial eCpriMasterStatisticsInterval differs from first interval from intervals list..
    should not be true                                          """${initial_interval}""" == """${first_interval}"""

    Robot Log Result                                            Initial interval and first interval differ
